  "body": "AGENTS.md \"400-line files\": no source file grows past about 400 lines.\n\n- `crates/app/src/mcp/features.rs` is 426 lines after PR #2716 (it was 320).\n- `crates/app/src/operation/stamp.rs` is 475 lines after PR #2716 (404 at PR #3125, 410 before #2716). Each first-traverse law of #2965, #3081, #3084, #3096 and #3100 added a stamp word there.\n\nWork:\n1. Split `stamp.rs` along the domain seam, for example the source digests (sketch, model, selection) apart from the law salts (the first-traverse words).\n2. Split `features.rs` along its tool groups.\n3. Keep every stamp byte-identical: no saved cache may read Stale after the split. Pin it with the existing stamp tests (`stock_stamp`, `deburr_cache_stamp`, `wire_stamp`, `stale_rapid_law`).\n",
